    {
      "text": "Lehi1 beholds strait and narrow path in vision, 1 Ne. 8:20. way for man is narrow, 2 Ne. 9:41. strait and narrow path leads to eternal life, 2 Ne. 31:18–19 (3 Ne. 14:14; 27:33; Matt. 7:14). enter into narrow gate, 2 Ne. 33:9. continue in way which is narrow, Jacob 6:11. narrow pass leads by sea into land northward, Alma 50:34 (52:9; 63:5; Morm. 2:29; 3:5; Ether 10:20). word of God leads man of Christ in strait and narrow course across gulf of misery, Hel. 3:29.",
